{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18574","headline":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇 · 柳宗元","name":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河右澶漫，顽爲之魁。\n王师如雷震，崑仑以颓。\n上聋下聪，骜不可廻。\n助雠抗有德，惟人之灾。\n乃溃乃奋，执缚归厥命。\n万室蒙其仁，一夫则病。\n濡以鸿泽，皇之圣。\n威畏德怀，功以定。\n顺之于理，物咸遂厥性。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}